
Beginner
* Number Guessing Game — Computer picks a number, and the player guesses it.
* Rock, Paper, Scissors — Play against the computer.
* Quiz Game — Multiple-choice questions with a score.
* Dice Rolling Game — Roll dice and compete against the computer.
* Hangman — Guess letters to figure out a hidden word.
🟡 Intermediate
* Tic-Tac-Toe — Two players or player vs. computer.
* Text Adventure — Explore rooms, collect items, and make choices.
* Snake — Use pygame to move around and eat food.
* Space Shooter — Control a spaceship and shoot incoming enemies.
* Pong — Two paddles, a ball, and a score counter.
🔴 A little more challenging
* Mini RPG — Fight monsters, gain XP, collect weapons, and level up.
* Dungeon Escape — Navigate a randomly generated dungeon while avoiding enemies.
* Tower Defense — Place towers to stop enemies from reaching your base.
* Flappy Bird clone — Control a character through obstacles.
* Platformer — Jump across platforms and avoid enemies.
